   "locators": [
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-schedule",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "Oral preparations containing more than 50 mg but not more than 200 mg per recommended daily dose of vitamin B6 will be",
     "quotePrefix": "Copy link to heading\") Summary\n\n",
     "quoteSuffix": " [rescheduled as Pharmacist Only",
     "startOffset": 481,
     "endOffset": 599,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:e3212f3b54eb2707d38d03a0dc7f552631fa01f5de28666017dcb96d9a2502ad",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "Summary"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-effective",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "The effect of our decision is that from 1 June 2027 products with low doses of vitamin B6 will continue to be available for general sale",
     "quotePrefix": "e, pyridoxal, or pyridoxamine.\n\n",
     "quoteSuffix": ", while products containing high",
     "startOffset": 1073,
     "endOffset": 1209,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:cb65af1dd3ba3e841f94358153140a91391216481ce5462a0d68e10568bea132",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "Summary"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-neuropathy",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "Vitamin B6 can cause peripheral neuropathy, and while the risk is greatest for higher intakes of vitamin B6, it cannot be excluded for doses less than 50 mg/day.",
     "quotePrefix": "nue to require a prescription.\n\n",
     "quoteSuffix": " It can be difficult for consume",
     "startOffset": 1768,
     "endOffset": 1929,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:f7d52091e65c28be0fb916599e08ad1cfef4a2cbee0be46644c5f34c157efd9d",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "Summary"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-chemname",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "Adverse event reports also suggest a lack of awareness about the presence of vitamin B6 in medicines, particularly if the label lists the chemical name without the common name ‘vitamin B6’.",
     "quotePrefix": "ines to be safe and effective.\n\n",
     "quoteSuffix": " Health professionals should be ",
     "startOffset": 3850,
     "endOffset": 4039,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:34e550caa27be601c184b2e319161ed71c17c46c3f05a6b1ce46ba2e066487c9",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "What health professionals should do"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-forms",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "- pyridoxine hydrochloride\n- pyridoxal 5-phosphate\n- pyridoxal 5-phosphate monohydrate.",
     "quotePrefix": "market through self-selection:\n\n",
     "quoteSuffix": "\n\nWhen included as active ingred",
     "startOffset": 4480,
     "endOffset": 4567,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:907261fdf2396c3b218232326eebd6059f5a1492cf5fbc1f395bfa9102c4042d",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "What health professionals should do"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-asequivalent",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "The available PDF summary will list the vitamin B6 ingredient, if present, using one of the above names and state how much is in the medicine as the equivalent amount of pyridoxine.",
     "quotePrefix": " of Therapeutic Goods (ARTG)\"). ",
     "quoteSuffix": "\n\n## [Copy link to heading](http",
     "startOffset": 4958,
     "endOffset": 5139,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:ae846c5641d2b23d127d6e6f786953def861ce1ea1416bba5089b74b3732bb9e",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "What health professionals should do"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-count",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "At the time of the final decision, there were at least 125 medicines on the Australian market providing more than 50 mg but not more than 200 mg vitamin B6 per maximum recommended daily dose.",
     "quotePrefix": "vitamin-b6-interim-decision/).\n\n",
     "quoteSuffix": " Of these, 116 were listed compl",
     "startOffset": 9327,
     "endOffset": 9518,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:555788772b203be7ae9aa267de8a101bba0fa684b0fc124010cc2920e6afa9ca",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "Background"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-final",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "(vitamin B6)\") on 25 November 2025.",
     "quotePrefix": "xine, pyridoxal or pyridoxamine ",
     "quoteSuffix": "\n\nA wide range of materials was ",
     "startOffset": 8426,
     "endOffset": 8461,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:ac36b089e5c2304c2b09d5e4a88537137d72af78943f01a57de7297fcb50712e",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "Background"
    },
    {
     "ref": "l-tga-b6-warning2022",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "since 1 March 2022, medicines containing daily doses of vitamin B6 over 10 mg or equivalent have been required to carry the following statement",
     "quotePrefix": "disease.\n\nBecause of this risk, ",
     "quoteSuffix": ":\n\n> “WARNING - Stop taking this",
     "startOffset": 6535,
     "endOffset": 6678,
     "properties": {
      "quoteHash": "sha256:fa7cf5974c917df74485d4d0c120722ba12f4d71556b721bcd8993053ab7fcdb",
      "offsetBasis": "CODE_POINT"
     },
     "section": "Background"
    }
   ]
