     "ref": "l-ods-vitamers",
     "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
     "quote": "It is the generic name for six compounds (vitamers) with vitamin B6 activity: pyridoxine, an alcohol; pyridoxal, an aldehyde; and pyridoxamine, which contains an amino group; and their respective 5’-phosphate esters.",
     "quotePrefix": "ilable as a dietary supplement. ",
